  "Q03": {
    "id": "Q03",
    "name": "olw",
    "format": "olw rt, offset(base)",
    "encoding_bits": "110001 base rt offset16",
    "original_bits": null,
    "original": null,
    "kind": "custom",
    "description": "满足 0*1* 位模式时加载",
    "rtl": "EA = R[base] + B(offset)\nd = Mem32[EA]\nc = d 从bit31到bit0具有“若干0后接若干1”的形式\nif c: R[rt] <- d\nelse: 不写任何寄存器\nnextPC <- P + 4",
    "other": "例：R[1]=0x20、offset=2，读地址 0x28。字为 0x00000007 时写回；为 0x00000005 时不写、无日志。 边界：0、0xffffffff 均满足条件；0 段或 1 段可为空。等价判断为 (d & (d+1)) == 0，d+1 按 32 位回绕。读出的内存数据参与 GRF 写使能判断。",
    "source": "P4 练习册（2020–2024 记录改编）",
    "stage": "P4",
    "group": "practice",
